  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x201c;The Seedling Multiplication and Distribution Center for Village Health Volunteers&#x201d; aims to establish a central facility where Village Health Volunteers can access resources for poultry, fisheries, tree seedlings, potato and vegetables farming. This project will empower our 275 trained and certified Village Health Volunteers in the Laiagam District of Enga Province. They will be also provided with the necessary tools and knowledge to improve their agricultural practice and enhance food security</narrative>
